<title>JAPAN: Fontaine -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fontaine -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.38		vs	    2.75</p>
<p> Operating	  452    million	  vs	  226    million</p>
<p> Current	    451    million	  vs	  231    million</p>
<p> Net		  192    million	  vs	  143    million</p>
<p> EPS		   31.34 yen	  vs	   24.39 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fontaine Co Ltd sells women&quot;s fashion wigs.</p>
